<title>LATVIA: PAREKSS BANK SAYS TO BE RATED BY THOMSON, STANDARD.</title>
<headline>PAREKSS BANK SAYS TO BE RATED BY THOMSON, STANDARD.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's Parekss bank said on Friday that it is currently being rated by rating agencies Thomson BankWatch and Standard &amp; Poors.</p>
<p>&quot;We will have two ratings and it is expected to take a couple of months before the ratings are actually assigned,&quot; the bank's spokeswoman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
